{
  "uid": "dms-sensor-overview",
  "title": "DMS – Sensor-Übersicht (10.1)",
  "description": "Default-Dashboard-Vorlage (Konzept 10.1: \"exportierbare Dashboard-Vorlagen ... Startpunkt, keine Pflichtnutzung\"). Deckt die urspruenglichen Piloten-Sensoren ab (registry-service/document-service, P11-S1) sowie den Scrape-Proxy des monitoring-service selbst, seit Phase 40 Session 4 zusaetzlich die gezielten Sensoren aus federation-hub-service/storage-service/plugin-orchestration-service. Weitere Sensoren aus künftigen Services erscheinen erst hier, sobald sie über monitoring-service gescraped werden - kein Vollretrofit in dieser Ausbaustufe.",
  "tags": ["dms", "monitoring", "10.1"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Aktive Instanzen (registry.instances.active_total)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(registry_instances_active_total)",
          "legendFormat": "aktive Instanzen"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Verpasste Heartbeats (registry.service.heartbeat.miss)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(registry_service_heartbeat_miss)",
          "legendFormat": "aktuell überfällig"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Ø Upload-Dauer (document.upload.duration)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(document_upload_duration_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(document_upload_duration_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Ø Dauer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Aktive Dokumente (document.count.active_total)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(document_count_active_total)",
          "legendFormat": "aktive Dokumente"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Uploads gesamt (document.upload.duration_count)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(document_upload_duration_count)",
          "legendFormat": "Uploads"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Scrape-Fehlversuche (monitoring.scrape.failures)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Immer-aktiver, nicht konfigurierbarer Sensor des monitoring-service selbst (siehe docs/services/monitoring-service.md) - zählt fehlgeschlagene Scrape-Versuche gegen Fach-Service-/metrics-Endpunkte.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "monitoring_scrape_failures_total",
          "legendFormat": "Fehlversuche gesamt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Prometheus-Scrape-Ziel (monitoring-service)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "1 = monitoring-service gerade erreichbar (der einzige Scrape-Kandidat von Prometheus, siehe infra/prometheus.yml).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"monitoring-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Handover-Retry-Cache Hinweg (federation_hub.retry_cache.forward_pending)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Phase 40 Session 4 - Tiefe des flüchtigen Prozessspeicher-Caches für noch nicht zugestellte Handover-Payloads (ADR 0081), direkt gegen das in ADR 0147 benannte Speicherdruck-Risiko.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(federation_hub_retry_cache_forward_pending)",
          "legendFormat": "zwischengespeicherte Payloads (Hinweg)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Handover-Retry-Cache Rückweg (federation_hub.retry_cache.result_pending)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Phase 40 Session 4 - Tiefe des flüchtigen Prozessspeicher-Caches für noch nicht zugestellte Ergebnis-Payloads (Rückweg, Phase 40 Session 3).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(federation_hub_retry_cache_result_pending)",
          "legendFormat": "zwischengespeicherte Payloads (Rückweg)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Replikations-Rückstand (storage.replication.backlog)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Phase 40 Session 4 - Anzahl object_copy-Zeilen mit Status 'pending'/'failed' über alle konfigurierten Ziele hinweg. Pull-on-scrape (ADR 0004), kein periodischer Sampler.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(storage_replication_backlog)",
          "legendFormat": "Rückstand"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Knoten-CPU-Auslastung (plugin_orchestration.node.cpu_usage_percent)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Phase 40 Session 4 - Migration der bereits per psutil gesampelten Werte auf echte Sensoren, additiv zum weiterhin von placement.py gelesenen cluster_node.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "max": 100, "min": 0 } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "plugin_orchestration_node_cpu_usage_percent",
          "legendFormat": "CPU-Auslastung"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Verfügbarer RAM (plugin_orchestration.node.available_ram_mb)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Phase 40 Session 4 - siehe Panel 11, gleiche Stichprobe.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "decmbytes" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "plugin_orchestration_node_available_ram_mb",
          "legendFormat": "verfügbarer RAM"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
